#: data/maps/Route105/scripts.inc:79
msgctxt "Route104_Text_DadPokenavCall"
msgid ""
"… … … … … …\n"
"… … … … … Beep!\p"
"DAD: Oh, {PLAYER}?\p"
"… … … … … …\n"
"Where are you now?\l"
"It sounds windy wherever you are.\p"
"I just heard from DEVON's MR. STONE\n"
"about your POKéNAV, so I decided\l"
"to give you a call.\p"
"It sounds like you're doing fine,\n"
"so that's fine with me.\p"
"You take care now.\p"
"… … … … … …\n"
"… … … … … Click!$"
msgstr ""
"…… …… ……\n"
"…… …… 哔！\p"
"爸爸：哦，是{PLAYER}吗？\p"
"…… …… ……\n"
"你现在在哪里？\l"
"你那边听起来风好大啊。\p"
"我刚刚听得文公司的茂木社长\n"
"说起你的宝可梦导航，\l"
"所以就打个电话给你。\p"
"听起来你过得不错，\n"
"那我就放心了。\p"
"自己多保重啊。\p"
"…… …… ……\n"
"…… …… 咔嚓！$"

#: data/maps/Route105/scripts.inc:95
msgctxt "Route104_Text_RegisteredDadInPokenav"
msgid ""
"Registered DAD NORMAN\n"
"in the POKéNAV.$"
msgstr ""
"在宝可梦导航中\n"
"登记了爸爸千里。$"
